integration_contract_versions ||--o{ integration_exchange_records
integration_exchange_records ||--o{ integration_exchange_attempts
integration_contracts ||--o{ integration_idempotency_records
integration_contracts ||--o{ integration_sync_cursors
integration_contracts ||--o{ contract_webhook_subscriptions
contract_webhook_subscriptions ||--o{ webhook_delivery_evidence

note as SECURITY_diagram_31_integration_contracts
  HIGH-VALUE API PROFILE
  Prefer OAuth 2.0 confidential clients with mTLS or DPoP sender-constrained
  tokens, strict TLS, audience restriction and versioned scopes. Credentials are
  secret-manager references, never stored plaintext. Message signing is added
  when non-repudiation is contractually required.
end note


